config BR2_PACKAGE_XMNPU_MODELS
	bool "xmnpu-models"
	default n
	help
	  YOLOv8n and YOLOv8s object detectors compiled for the GK7205V5x0
	  NPU, for majestic's object detection. Eight classes: person, bicycle,
	  car, motorcycle, bus, truck, cat and dog (majestic reports them as
	  human, vehicle and animal). Fine-tuned with LeakyReLU, which the
	  NPU fuses into the convolution. Installed into the NAND (UBIFS)
	  rootfs only: they do not fit a NOR image. AGPL-3.0, from the
	  Ultralytics weights.

	  https://github.com/OpenIPC/xmnpu-models
